es/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なあちゃんキャワユイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日もhappyな一日でしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってね、皆さんのコメントも見たし、友達とも遊んだし、\nそれに........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サンフレッチェ広島\nvs\nセレッソ大阪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日本一を決める試合、ビッグアーチでありましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見事日本一おめでとうございますですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/25/1807466/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島の誇りです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.githu